//www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/wuxiaobao.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"姚　斌","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-yaobin","title":"教授","email":"yaobin@cs.sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/yaobin.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/yaobin.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n姚斌\n，上海交通大学计算机学院教授，国家优青，机器智能研究所副所长。从事数据库、大数据分析系统、数据挖掘、人工智能等领域研究，发表SIGMOD、VLDB、ICDE、HPCA、VLDBJ、TKDE等高水平学术论文90余篇，获专利授权33项，参与编写两项","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/yaobin.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"俞　凯","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-yukai","title":"特聘教授","supervisor":"博导","email":"kai.yu@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/yukai.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/yukai.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n现任上海交通大学计算机学院特聘教授、博导，机器智能研究所所长，思必驰公司联合创始人及首席科学家。语言计算国家人工智能开放创新平台负责人，江苏省语言计算及应用重点实验室主任。国际语音通讯联盟会士（ISCA Fellow），美国电子电气工程师协会会士（I","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/yukai.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"张健夫","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-zhangjianfu","title":"长聘教轨副教授","email":"c.sis@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangjianfu.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangjianfu.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n张健夫，上海交通大学计算机学院助理教授，研究方向为视觉内容生成与可信赖人工智能模型。本科毕业于上海交通大学ACM班，后于上海交通大学计算机系获博士学位。曾赴日本理化研究所（RIKEN）人工智能项目组担任访问研究员。目前，他已在CVPR、ICCV、IC","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangjianfu.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"张丽清","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-zhangliqing","title":"长聘教授","supervisor":"博导","email":"lqzhang@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangliqing.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangliqing.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n1983毕业于杭州大学数学系，1988年获中山大学计算机科学系理学博士学位。1995年在华南理工大学电子与信息学院任教授，博士生导师，1997.11-2002.8在日本理化学研究所脑科学综合研究中心任研究员，2002.9回国到上海交通大学电信学院计算","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangliqing.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"张拳石","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-zhangquanshi","title":"长聘副教授","email":"zqs1022@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangquanshi.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangquanshi.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n『能否通过简洁的符号化逻辑严谨且全面地解释神经网络表征机理』是可解释性领域的核心科学问题，但长年找不到理论突破口，在学界形成“不可能解决”的惯性思维，此看法长期桎梏着从内在机理层面实现可信推理与安全执行，成为解释性算法所公认的最大的应用障碍。张拳石科","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhangquanshi.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"招浩华","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-zhaohaohua","title":"助理研究员","email":"haoh.zhao@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhaohaohua.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhaohaohua.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n长期致力于机器学习与计算机视觉领域的前沿研究，主要研究方向包括机器学习、计算机视觉、类脑计算与深度学习等前沿领域。在多模式神经网络人类动作识别、稀疏编码图像去噪及跨视角步态识别等方向，已在国际期刊和会议上发表多篇学术论文。\n教育背景\n博士：上海交通大","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/zhaohaohua.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"邓志杰","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-dengzhijie","title":"长聘教轨副教授","supervisor":"博导","email":"zhijied@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dengzhijie.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dengzhijie.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n邓志杰，副教授，博士生导师。主要研究方向为生成模型，相关技术应用于美团LongCat等业界大模型。在TPAMI、ICML、CVPR等会议和期刊上发表论文50余篇，包括多篇Spotlight。任ICLR、CVPR、ACL等会议领域主席。获NVAIL P","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/dengzhijie.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"顾磊磊","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-guleilei","title":"长聘教轨副教授","supervisor":"博导","email":"leilei.gu@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/guleilei.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/guleilei.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n顾磊磊，上海交通大学计算机学院长聘教轨副教授，博士生导师。研究方向聚焦于仿生视觉传感器，通过生物启发的传感器及处理算法软硬一体的联合设计，构建小算力、低功耗的仿生视觉系统，提高无人机、微/小型机器人以及人本身等资源受限场景下的智能视觉感知能力。以第一","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/guleilei.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"刘鹏飞","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-liupengfei","title":"长聘教轨副教授","email":"pengfei@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/liupengfei.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/liupengfei.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n刘鹏飞，上海交通大学副教授、创智学院导师（标杆项目负责人），入选国家级青年人才计划、上海市领军人才 (海外青年)，交大生成式人工智能研究组（GAIR）负责人, 获得首届蚂蚁InTech科技奖。曾和卡耐基梅隆大学（全美CS第一）教授联合教授成立AI公司","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/liupengfei.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"李钟毓","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-lizhongyu","title":"长聘教轨副教授","supervisor":"博导","email":"zhongyuli@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/lizhongyu.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/lizhongyu.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n李钟毓，长聘教轨副教授，博士生导师。主要研究方向为智慧医疗、计算神经科学、计算机视觉和深度学习。以第一作者或第一通讯作者在Nature Methods, IEEE TMI, IEEE TIP, Medical Image Analysis, MICC","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/lizhongyu.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"王德泉","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-wangdequan","title":"长聘教轨副教授","supervisor":"博导","email":"dequanwang@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/wangdequan.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/wangdequan.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["computer","cyber"],"bio_excerpt":"个人简介\n上海交通大学计算机学院长聘教轨副教授、博士生导师，上海创智学院全时导师，入选国家高层次青年人才计划、上海市海外高层次青年人才计划。本科毕业于复旦大学，博士毕业于加州大学伯克利分校，师从 Trevor Darrell 教授。主要研究方向为大模型智能体驱","provenance":{"bio_raw":{"origin":"crawled","source":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/wangdequan.html","fetched_at":"2026-09-02","confidence":"auto"}}},{"name":"徐宁仪","school":"sjtu","school_name":"上海交通大学","dept":"cs","dept_name":"计算机学院（网络空间安全学院、密码学院）","page":"sjtu-cs-xuningyi","title":"长聘教授","email":"xuningyi@sjtu.edu.cn","detail_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/xuningyi.html","profile_url":"https://www.cs.sjtu.edu.cn/jiaoshiml/xuningyi.html","source_date":"2026-09-02","unit_groups":["comp